1. made a conda env:
   conda create -n pinns python=3.10
   conda activate pinns

2. In this i installed tensor flow:
   pip install tensorflow[and-cuda]

3. installed supporting libraries:
   pip install numpy scipy matplotlib jupyter
   pip install sympy tqdm

There are different folders.
1. nanoHUB is a follow along with: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o9JaZGWekWQ&t=1471s
